      "side": 1,
      "message": "From looking at https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:external/avb/libavb/avb_slot_verify.c;l\u003d112, which doesn\u0027t seem to allow short read, I think the doc might be outdated. The expected size comes from hash descriptor and will be used to calculate hash, which kind of suggest it must be an exact match always.",
