      "writtenOn": "2025-07-22T21:21:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Gotcha. Do we expect the backend to actually be able to change the size of their preloaded data? IIRC the behavior right now is to just tell libavb the size of whatever buffer the backend provides, and let it error out if it\u0027s the wrong size. What\u0027s the advantage of adding the extra parameter here?",
      "parentUuid": "83a8601b_a7cd820c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 78,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 78,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "160c69e2de476d16378ef756c36725ce40d3e761",
